WEBVTT

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.740
(Based on Mo Xiang Tong Xiu's novel
of the same name)

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:27.350
(Adult Supervision Is Recommended)

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.210
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:58.970
♪As such♪

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:02.850
♪I will grant your chivalry♪

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:05.010
♪As such♪

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.410
♪I search for you in my memories,
I yearn for you to remember♪

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:12.850
♪The green hills, the bamboo forests,
and the clouds in the sky♪

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:15.770
♪Everywhere♪

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:21.850
♪I regret not the time we spent together♪

00:01:22.130 --> 00:01:27.850
♪Awakening the promise never forgotten♪

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:33.530
♪A song of love and sorrow♪

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:40.450
♪A cherished love♪

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:46.090
♪Can never be parted♪

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:52.490
♪We shared wine and sorrows
underneath the moonlight♪

00:01:52.850 --> 00:02:01.455
♪I will walk with you
to the end of the world♪

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:07.930
=The Founder of Diabolism=
(The Final Chapter)

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:11.290
=Episode 6=
(The Venerated Triad)

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:25.650
It's about time.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:47.360
Lan...

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.940
(Four Seasons Grapefruit, Summer Drink)

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.260
(Four Seasons Grapefruit, Real Fruit)

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.940
(Four Seasons Grapefruit)

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.160
The fragrance of tea.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:01.600
Fruits.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:04.060
Oh, it's the Four Seasons Grapefruit.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.250
Don't fool around.

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:25.600
You must be careful.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:36.790
Fairy?

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:38.900
Is there anything in the sky?

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:41.990
There's nothing there.

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.070
That gave me a scare.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.990
Xichen, Guangyao,

00:03:49.990 --> 00:03:52.460
could you please help me again?

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:39.820
There's nothing in the envelope.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:51.830
Qin Su?

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:53.410
What's going on?

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:55.020
She looked fine

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.720
in the banquet hall earlier.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:58.600
Su?

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:01.280
What's the matter?

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.760
You don't look well.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:05.720
Don't come over!

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:08.310
All because of this?

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:10.000
Su,

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.440
who gave you this letter?

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:14.870
Tell me. Is it true?

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:16.400
Everything that was written
in the letter.

00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:18.110
Tell me!

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:20.110
Tell me it's not true!

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:24.700
It's not true.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.320
It's all lies.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.040
Song...

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:36.040
It was you who...

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:38.750
Look.

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:41.100
I told you it was a lie.
But you don't believe me.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.750
You're making things hard for me.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:45.150
All right. That's enough.

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.950
Don't over-think things.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:51.430
Now, tell me.

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.810
Who gave you this letter?

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:56.890
You're inhumane!

00:05:57.260 --> 00:05:58.720
You're a lunatic!

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:00.720
Su.

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.920
I know you won't believe
anything I say now.

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:06.890
But my feelings for you were sincere.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:10.650
You never minded my past

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:11.870
or my mother's lowly status.

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:13.870
And I've always been grateful
to you for that.

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:17.200
I respected you,
cared for you, and loved you.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:19.200
But you must understand this.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.910
Even if Song was never murdered,

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:22.780
he still had to die.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.340
He had to die.

00:06:29.730 --> 00:06:31.580
A tiger, though cruel,
will never devour its cubs.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:34.960
What won't and can't you do

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.580
for your status and position?

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:40.840
Are you really not going to tell me?

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:42.600
Why?

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.670
So that you can silence them as well?

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:47.430
It seems

00:06:47.740 --> 00:06:49.200
that you are ill, my dear.

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:51.750
Let me take you back to your room.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:55.080
Don't come closer... Don't...

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.000
You...

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.310
That's enough.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:13.760
That mirror!

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:15.770
So that's how it works.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.900
Don't be afraid, Su.

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.690
Just tell me who gave you that letter,

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.690
and you'll be able to go back.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.010
Don't make me worry, all right?

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.413
(Sacrificial Ritual)

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:13.110
The scripture of the Sacrificial Ritual
was with Jin Guangyao?

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.690
Then how did Mo Xuanyu
get his hands on it?

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:21.200
Yunping City?

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:23.020
I knew it.

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.910
All right. The guests are still outside.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.550
I'll come back to check on you later.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:38.810
Were you

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.720
the one staring at me earlier?

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:53.900
It has been a long while,

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:55.720
Chifeng-zun.

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:14.630
Wei Ying.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:16.280
Lan Zhan?

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:34.280
This is... The Sunshot Campaign.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:37.310
Kill them!

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.590
Wei Ying, stop!

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.560
Hey, Lan Zhan.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:08.550
It's you.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:16.950
Wei Ying!

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:18.430
Please stop!

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:19.940
It's not too late!

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:35.910
Lan Wangji,

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:38.600
must you stand against me?

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.170
Wei Ying!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.210
Lan Zhan.

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:52.290
Why did I think

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.300
that you hated me back then?

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:57.710
I never hated you.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.120
I just...

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:04.990
Looking at the scene,

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:07.120
this must be the period
during the Sunshot Campaign.

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.140
We need to go back further

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.310
to find out the cause
of the deterioration

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:12.970
of Nie Mingjue
and Jin Guangyao's relationship.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:34.350
Here. Have some water.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:36.420
Thank you.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:37.940
Brother Mingjue.

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:43.610
Have you heard?

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:46.520
Clan Leader Jiang of Yunmeng's reputation
is certainly soaring these days.

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:48.060
Of course. How could it not?

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.100
Wei Wuxian can control armies of corpses
with his flute alone.

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:53.070
He alone is worth an army of a million.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.700
Your brother left
for Yunmeng as well, right?

00:11:57.340 --> 00:11:58.010
Mm.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.710
He is skilled.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.710
The Wen dogs will have much
to suffer this time.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:05.970
Not bad.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.050
Chifeng-zun has a good eye.

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:10.390
Speaking of which, Brother Mingjue,

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:13.300
do you still remember
that benefactor from Yunmeng

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.600
I mentioned?

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:16.320
Of course.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:18.320
I would very much like to meet

00:12:18.320 --> 00:12:20.430
such a righteous and benevolent man.

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:22.130
Benefactor?

00:12:22.490 --> 00:12:24.430
During the time when
the Cloud Recesses was burned down,

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.400
Brother hid in Yunmeng for months.

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:31.150
I heard that he is under your wing
right now, Brother Mingjue.

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:33.270
Oh? Who is he?

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.580
What? Jin Guangshan's son?

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:39.810
How could Jin Guangshan's son
be among people like us?

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.510
No, wait.
Why didn't he go and find his father?

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:45.400
You think he never tried?

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:47.920
He brought a token with him
to Jinlintai last year.

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:49.410
And guess what happened?

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:53.070
He was kicked off the stairs of Jinlintai.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:55.700
That makes sense.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:58.210
Jin Guangshan is terrified of his wife.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.430
He wouldn't dare acknowledge him.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.150
Of course, he wouldn't.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.760
His mother was a prostitute.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:05.270
Who knows who is his real father?

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.600
Have you come

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.200
to kill those Wen dogs or to gossip?

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:22.070
Clan Leader.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:29.260
A man should stand up straight

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.890
and mind no gossip.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:32.320
Yes, sir.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:35.800
Your performance before, during, and after
every battle for the past few months

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:38.790
has been outstanding.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.910
The more these people
talk behind your back,

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:44.400
the more you must prove them wrong.

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:46.140
From now on,

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:49.510
Meng Yao will be my right-hand man.

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:57.690
Was Clan Leader Lan's benefactor

00:13:58.680 --> 00:13:59.960
Jin Guangyao?

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:02.480
It would seem so.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:24.480
(Wen Clan of Qishan)

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:41.990
Yao.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.400
Zewu-jun.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:47.900
No need for formalities.

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.170
The battle at Langya is fierce.

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.500
Clan Leader Jin has been

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:52.860
looking for capable cultivators
to join his army.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.860
I recall that you once told me

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:57.510
that you wished
to earn your father's approval

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.390
and a place in Jinlintai.

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:02.190
I can't leave Hejian.

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:04.070
I'm indebted to Clan Leader Nie.

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:04.460
I...

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.290
I didn't promote you

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.140
because I wanted you
to be indebted to me.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:10.590
Clan Leader Nie.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.930
I promoted you
because of your capabilities

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.530
and your good character.

00:15:16.010 --> 00:15:17.530
If you wish to repay me,

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:19.723
then kill more of those Wen dogs
on the battlefield.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:20.480
(Letter of Recommendation)

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:22.010
Take this letter of recommendation

00:15:22.010 --> 00:15:23.520
and leave for Langya

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:24.680
today.

00:15:25.110 --> 00:15:26.280
To find your father.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:29.340
Clan Leader Nie.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.240
Zewu-jun.

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:35.350
What?

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:36.930
(Langya Camp)
You never met Meng Yao?

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:38.690
That's right.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:43.040
If I had known that you had sent
your right-hand man over,

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.040
I would have made sure
that he was treated well.

00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:48.800
Speaking of which, Clan Leader Nie,

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:52.110
we are surrounded on all sides
by the Wens right now,

00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:54.910
do you have a way to defeat them?

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:57.220
Clan Leaders, I have an idea.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:15:58.370
Please have a look.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:07.930
You're as shameless as those Wen dogs!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.930
That's Jin Guangyao's handwriting.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.680
Meng Yao, what are you doing?

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:37.990
Clan Leader Nie.

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:41.250
Clan Leader Nie, you must let me explain!

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:42.580
I had no choice!

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.260
This man was my superior.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:45.520
But he had always looked down on me

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:47.150
and humiliated me.

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:48.850
So you killed him?

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:49.560
No!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:51.910
I would not have killed him
if that had been all he did!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:53.230
The plan that I had worked so hard on

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:55.290
was stolen by him

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:57.370
when he presented it to my father.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.800
And he even called my mother...

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:01.250
He even said my mother was a...

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:04.040
I simply couldn't take it any longer,

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:05.600
so in a moment of anger, I...

00:17:06.880 --> 00:17:07.850
You're lying!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:09.850
You would not have purposely used

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.400
a Wen's sword to kill him
if you had just lost your temper.

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:15.340
It was calculated.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.770
You planned this!

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:18.890
Everything I've said

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:19.820
is true!

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:21.070
Meng Yao.

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:22.070
Tell me.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.940
That day at Hejian,

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:25.310
did you also pretend

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:27.680
to be a weak victim so that I would

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.880
stand up for you that time?

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.550
No, I didn't!

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:34.050
If I hadn't stood up for you,

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:36.620
would you have done what you did today

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.670
and killed all of them too?

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:42.460
I won't do anything to you.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.950
Go and confess your sins
to your father yourself.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.060
If what you said was indeed true,

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:49.820
your life would be spared.

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:51.070
Go.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.610
Repent and turn over a new leaf.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:58.280
Chifeng-zun...

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:02.670
You have sentenced me to death.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:15.280
You...

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:17.030
Clan Leader Nie,

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:18.150
I...

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.950
I have forsaken your kindness.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.080
Hang in there.

00:18:22.190 --> 00:18:23.830
I'll channel spiritual energy
into you right now.

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:34.960
Meng Yao.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:36.680
You had better make sure

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.910
that you never fall into my hands.

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.860
(Nevernight City)

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:47.990
Clan Leader Nie,

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:49.610
it has been a while.

00:18:51.170 --> 00:18:52.760
I never expected that there would

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.200
come a day where you would
be in such a pitiful state too.

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:56.680
This is my first time
seeing him like this too.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.410
Based on the timeline,

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:00.480
this should be
the 23rd year of Xuanzheng.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.670
When they lost the raid at Yangquan.

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:03.810
Get away from me!

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:06.430
Do you think
you are still the ruler of Hejian?

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:08.030
Look carefully.

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:09.960
This is the Yanyang Hall.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.390
What Yanyang Hall?

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.490
It's just the nest
of a bunch of Wen dogs!

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:19.790
You...

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:21.850
You Wen dog,

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:23.890
kill us all if you dare!

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:26.680
Does anyone else have something to say?

00:19:27.080 --> 00:19:28.460
You Wen dog...

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:39.200
Wen Ruohan killed Chifeng-zun's father,

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:40.580
right?

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:41.290
Mm.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:43.920
Wen Ruohan tampered
with the late Clan Leader Nie's saber.

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:45.920
When the late Clan Leader Nie
went night hunting,

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:47.760
the saber shattered, and he died.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:58.350
To force someone to kneel and kowtow
before his father's murderer,

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:00.010
Jin Guangyao

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.090
is killing him by destroying his spirit.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.140
Brother Mingjue.

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:17.770
Brother Mingjue.

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.340
The 23rd year of Xuanzheng,

00:20:21.340 --> 00:20:22.520
Nie Mingjue was rescued.

00:20:23.170 --> 00:20:24.590
And the Nie clan was recuperated.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:26.700
Months later,

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:30.650
the four major clans led tens of thousands
of cultivators to attack Nevernight City.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:33.320
Clan Leader Nie and my brother

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.550
fought with Wen Ruohan
for over three hundred rounds.

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:38.800
Meng Yao waited for an opportunity
and stabbed Wen Ruohan,

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:42.440
killing him at Yanyang Hall.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:50.380
You won't get away

00:20:50.380 --> 00:20:51.630
this time!

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:53.910
Yao!

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:56.790
Brother Mingjue,

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:58.280
Yao had no choice.

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.730
He became the Wen dogs' fangs and claws

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:00.700
and gave succor to the enemy!

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:02.200
And you're telling me he had no choice?

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:03.300
Out of my way!

00:21:03.580 --> 00:21:04.280
Brother Mingjue!

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.740
Do you know who risked rescuing you
from Nevernight City?

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:10.260
All right then.

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:11.570
After I kill him,

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:12.710
I'll take my own life!

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:16.150
Xichen!

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:17.150
Brother Mingjue,

00:21:17.700 --> 00:21:19.310
You wanted to know

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:21.510
who had been secretly sending us intel
for the past year, didn't you?

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:23.600
After the incident at Langya,

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.070
Yao had regretted what he did

00:21:25.440 --> 00:21:27.110
and found a way to infiltrate Qishan

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:28.180
and got close to Wen Ruohan.

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:29.720
He did that to atone for his mistakes.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.440
To atone for his mistakes?

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:35.260
For the past year,
you have killed countless men and allies

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:37.110
of ours as you did that day.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:39.620
I was pretending
to be one of Wen Ruohan's aides.

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:40.810
How could I not do anything

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:42.480
when you're insulted?

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:45.150
I know that I carry grave sins.

00:21:45.350 --> 00:21:46.420
That day at the Yanyang Hall,

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:47.890
I had no choice but to do what I did.

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:49.870
But I am truly sorry for that.

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:52.960
Today, I was able to kill Wen Ruohan

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:54.770
together with the help
of Clan Leader Nie and Zewu-jun,

00:21:54.770 --> 00:21:55.770
and to restore peace for civilians.

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:57.380
My wish has been fulfilled.

00:21:58.650 --> 00:21:59.890
Clan Leader Nie.

00:22:01.190 --> 00:22:02.020
Do as you wish.

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.100
Brother Mingjue!

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:12.800
In the end, Chifeng-zun's saber

00:22:13.190 --> 00:22:14.560
never landed.

00:22:15.370 --> 00:22:16.900
In this battle,
Jin Guangyao's reputation soared.

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:18.510
He returned to Jinlintai.

00:22:19.310 --> 00:22:20.900
The three of them
became the Venerated Triad,

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:22.230
and their feud eased.

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:24.580
But in less than four years,

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:27.990
Nie Mingjue qi deviated
and died a bloody death.

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:32.010
I'm sure there's more to it than that.

00:22:45.200 --> 00:22:46.360
♪The swallows♪

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:47.480
♪Fly away♪

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:49.600
♪Knowing the way back♪

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:51.240
♪I strum the strings♪

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:52.440
♪And play the song♪

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:54.240
♪Wondering when you'll return♪

00:22:54.840 --> 00:22:56.080
♪Who is sighing♪

00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:57.120
♪In sorrow?♪

00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:59.440
♪The world is full of separation♪

00:22:59.720 --> 00:23:00.880
♪When all is said and done♪

00:23:00.960 --> 00:23:03.520
♪I cherish every moment we are together♪

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:05.680
♪A toast♪

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:06.960
♪To the lush mountains♪

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:08.720
♪We sit in a boat, gazing up to the moon♪

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:10.480
♪A gentle mist blows♪

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:11.600
♪On the shore♪

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:13.680
♪How peaceful the world seems♪

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:15.160
♪Who is playing the flute?♪

00:23:15.320 --> 00:23:16.480
♪Separated in our previous lives♪

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:18.320
♪I can only hope to meet you again
come next life♪

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:20.080
♪No amount of gold♪

00:23:20.160 --> 00:23:23.560
♪Would bring me to give up
these precious memories♪

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:27.200
♪I wish never to forget those years♪

00:23:27.200 --> 00:23:29.920
♪I spent searching for you♪

00:23:30.360 --> 00:23:31.440
♪Through the mountains and rivers♪

00:23:31.480 --> 00:23:34.640
♪I've searched for you♪

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:36.760
♪There you were♪

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:39.200
♪By the dim light♪

00:23:39.440 --> 00:23:43.200
♪Although there is no wind,
my heart flutters♪

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:46.520
♪I'll overcome all the obstacles♪

00:23:46.640 --> 00:23:48.960
♪To spend the rest of my life with you♪

00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:51.280
♪One dressed in white,
one clad in black♪

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:53.960
♪Playing a song together♪

00:23:54.200 --> 00:23:56.160
♪As we watch the sunset♪

00:23:56.600 --> 00:23:58.360
♪Sharing a blissful moment♪

00:23:58.560 --> 00:24:01.720
♪Away from the troubles of the world♪
